{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18467","headline":"东风二章 一 · 欧阳詹","name":"东风二章 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东风叶时，匪沃匪飘。\n莫雪凝川，莫阴沍郊。\n朝不徯夕乃销，东风之行地上兮。\n上德临慝，匪戮匪枭。\n莫暴在野，莫丑在阶。\n以踣以歼，夕不徯朝，陇西公来浚都兮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18467.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18467","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}